; Regression test for issue #3243: a payee equal to the identifier but
; for case is the best match after an exact one.
;
; Only a payee identical to the identifier counted as an exact match, so
; `xact kroger` scored "Kroger" like any payee starting with "kroger" and
; drafted from the more recent "Kroger Fuel".  A payee equal to the
; identifier when case is ignored now outranks every merely similar
; payee and, like an exact match, alone chooses the account in `convert
; --auto-match`, so "Shell" decides a "SHELL" line despite three newer
; visits to "Shell Beach Cafe".  A payee identical to the identifier
; still comes first: `xact Acme` drafts from "Acme" though "ACME" is
; more recent.

2026-06-01 * Acme
    Expenses:Supplies                     10.00 USD
    Assets:Checking

2026-06-10 * ACME
    Expenses:Hardware                     20.00 USD
    Assets:Checking

2026-06-11 * Shell
    Expenses:Auto:Fuel                    40.00 USD
    Assets:Checking

2026-06-12 * Shell Beach Cafe
    Expenses:Dining                       20.00 USD
    Assets:Checking

2026-06-13 * Shell Beach Cafe
    Expenses:Dining                       22.00 USD
    Assets:Checking

2026-06-14 * Shell Beach Cafe
    Expenses:Dining                       18.00 USD
    Assets:Checking

2026-06-20 * Kroger
    Expenses:Groceries                    50.00 USD
    Assets:Checking

2026-06-25 * Kroger Fuel
    Expenses:Auto:Fuel                    40.00 USD
    Assets:Checking

test --now 2026/06/30 xact kroger
2026/06/30 Kroger
    Expenses:Groceries                     50.00 USD
    Assets:Checking
end test

test --now 2026/06/30 xact Acme
2026/06/30 Acme
    Expenses:Supplies                      10.00 USD
    Assets:Checking
end test

test --now 2026/06/30 xact acme
2026/06/30 ACME
    Expenses:Hardware                      20.00 USD
    Assets:Checking
end test

test --auto-match --account Assets:Checking convert $sourcepath/test/input/3243_nocase.csv
2026/07/01 * KROGER
    Expenses:Groceries                           -60
    Assets:Checking

2026/07/02 * SHELL
    Expenses:Auto:Fuel                           -45
    Assets:Checking
end test
